<section class="kube-start-section" aria-labelledby="learning-path-title">
  <div class="kube-section-container">
    <div class="kube-home-section-heading">
      <div><p class="kube-label">Less searching. More learning.</p><h2 id="learning-path-title">A clear path through cloud &amp; agent security.</h2></div>
      <p>New to agentic security? Begin with Agentic Cloud Security. Already comfortable? Jump into threat modeling, CEH, or zero trust.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="kube-learning-grid">
      <a class="kube-learning-card" href="/labs/agentic-cloud-security/"><span class="kube-learning-step">01 · Start here</span><h3>Agentic Cloud Security</h3><p>Guardrails, sandboxing, MCP security, and autonomous workload governance.</p><span class="kube-learning-action">Open lab guide →</span></a>
      <a class="kube-learning-card" href="/labs/Zero-Trust-Architecture/"><span class="kube-learning-step">02 · Architecture</span><h3>Zero-Trust Security</h3><p>Verify explicitly, least privilege access, and assume breach principles.</p><span class="kube-learning-action">Open lab guide →</span></a>
      <a class="kube-learning-card" href="/labs/Security-Engineering-Fundamentals/"><span class="kube-learning-step">03 · Systems</span><h3>Security Engineering</h3><p>Cryptography, network defense, system hardening, and resilient pipelines.</p><span class="kube-learning-action">Open lab guide →</span></a>
      <a class="kube-learning-card" href="/labs/Threat-Modeling/"><span class="kube-learning-step">04 · Strategy</span><h3>Threat Modeling</h3><p>STRIDE analysis, attack trees, and defense-in-depth for complex architectures.</p><span class="kube-learning-action">Open lab guide →</span></a>
    </div>
    <form class="kube-home-search" action="/tools/" method="get" role="search" aria-label="Search the tool directory">
      <label for="home-tool-search">Looking for a tool instead?</label>
      <div><input id="home-tool-search" type="search" name="q" placeholder="Search AI defense, CSPM, zero trust, runtime…"/><button class="kube-button" type="submit">Find tools →</button></div>
      <p>A curated directory of 37,000+ security tools, with filters you can bookmark and share.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

